OL,3,GNEWSAStrictly's Horwood revels in role
OL,4,Aas panto villain
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe line-up for one of a city's biggest
OL,7,FChristmas pantomimes has been
OL,8,Fannounced.
OL,10,FCraig Revel Horwood, Andy Ford and BBC
OL,11,FRadio Bristol's Joe Sims are all
OL,12,Fjoining the cast for a rendition of
OL,13,FSleeping Beauty at the Bristol
OL,14,FHippodrome for the month of December.
OL,16,FStrictly Come Dancing judge Revel
OL,17,FHorwood has been cast as this year's
OL,18,Fpantomime villain, Sleeping Beauty's
OL,19,Fwicked aunt Carabosse and is relishing
OL,20,Fthe prospect.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
